Package: rnaSentry
Type: Package
Title: Guarded and Auditable Discovery of Prognostic RNA-Seq Signatures
Version: 0.99.8
Authors@R: person("Abdelkarim Hani", "Ghrieb",
    email = "ghriebabdelkarimhani@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Orchestrates the statistical pipeline underlying prognostic
    biomarker discovery from bulk RNA-seq SummarizedExperiment objects:
    sample-identity and quality-control auditing, confounder and
    design-formula detection prior to differential expression, signature
    construction with explicit cross-validation stability reporting,
    survival modeling (Kaplan-Meier, log-rank, Cox proportional hazards),
    and external validation against public cohorts. Every automated
    statistical decision is reported with its supporting statistic and a
    plain-language rationale, and validation stages are gated rather than
    silently degraded when guardrail criteria are not met. The package
    records all guardrail decisions, flag ledgers, and validation results
    in a structured audit trail that can be rendered into a standalone HTML
    report.
